<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Heinrich Barth</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Heinrich Barth was a German explorer and scholar who travelled extensively in North and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/west-africa">West Africa</a> in the mid-nineteenth century. His detailed accounts of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sokoto-caliphate">Sokoto Caliphate</a> and neighbouring states documented their trade, society and history. His work remains a valuable source for historians of the region.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/heinrich-barth.jpg" alt="Heinrich Barth" width="245" height="420" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown authorUnknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Barth_Unterschrift.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
